  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Tom plays the piano. The piano is big and brown. Pip is not in the room with them. Lily and Mia play a game. The music plays, and they walk. Then the music stops. \"Stop!\" says Tom. \"Point to your ear.\" Lily and Mia point to their ears.",
      "The music plays again. Lily and Mia walk and clap. The music stops. \"Stop! Point to your eye,\" says Tom. They point to their eyes. \"Stop! Point to your nose.\" They point to their noses. \"Where is Pip?\" asks Mia. Mia looks under the table. She looks behind the door.",
      "Lily looks at the big box. She sees two brown ears! It is a very big box. Pip sits in the box. \"Woof!\" says Pip. Lily claps her hands and smiles. Mom has a camera. \"Smile!\" says Mom. Mom takes a photo of the children and Pip. Pip is very funny in this game!"
    ],
    "summary": "Tom plays the piano and the girls walk. When the music stops, Tom gives a command. Pip sits in a big box, and Mom takes a photo.",
